(33, 'Effects of various soil management practice on earthworm population structure across rainy and post-rainy seasons under the maize crop', 'Original Research Article I Volume 1 I Issue 4 I 2015', 'V. Srinivas Reddy, N. Venu and M. Vikram Reddy', 'American Journal of Science and Medical Research; 1(4); 120-128', 'http://dx.doi.org/10.17812/ajsmr2015143', '../pdffiles/cimg102537_11.21 SRINIVAS REDDY 120-128.pdf', 'Earthworms are known for their beneficial role in the soil system since the time immemorial. The  present investigation was undertaken to assess the effects of various soil management practice on earthworm population structure, both number and biomass (wet), across rainy and postrainy seasons under the maize crop. ', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;&#10;margin-left:.25in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.25in;&#10;line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">Andersen, A. 1987 . Effects of direct drilling and ploughing on populations of earthworms. Tidskrift Planteavl. 91; 3-14. (In Danish with English Summary).<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;&#10;margin-left:.25in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-.25in;&#10;line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&