l. Med., 7: 377&ndash;408...<o:p></o:p></span></p>', 'Anticaner, Artocarpus heterophyllus, MTT assay, MCF-7, MDA-MB-231.  ', 'Veenavani Marka, Madhu Kamarapu, Ravulakolanu Vanisree and Prameela Devi Yalavarthy (2016). Anticancer activity of crude extracts from leaves of Artocarpus heterophyllus. The Ame J Sci & Med Res, 3(2):12-14;. doi:10.17812/ajsmr3204.', 'Received: 19 March 2017; Accepted:  21 May, 2017; Published: 24 June 2017', 1),
(63, 'Analysis and seasonal variations of physico-chemical parameters of Pakhal Lake, Narsampet, District Warangal, Telangana (India)', 'Original Research Article I Volume 3 I Issue 2 I 2017', 'E. Narayana and E. Raju', 'The American Journal of Science and Medical Research; 3(2); 20-24', 'http://dx.doi.org/10.17812/ajsmr3206', '../pdffiles/cimg082900_3206 naraya 20-.pdf', 'Pakhal lake is the key source for domestic and irrigation purposes in the Pakhal area, Narsampet Mandal, Warangal Dist. has been assessed physico-chemically to evaluate its suitability for domestic and irrigation purposes. The physico-chemical characteristics were studied and analyzed during the period of one year. The important parameters taken into consideration are Temperature, PH, Electrical conductivity, Turbidity, TDS, Total alkalinity, Total hardness, Dissolved oxygen, BOD, COD, Chlorine, Sulphur, Phosphorus, Nitrate and Calcium were determined in the laboratory. The physico-chemical parameters were dertermined as per standard methods of APHA (2005). The results revealed that the condition of this lake in month wise analysis showed fluctuations in physico-chemical parameters. agent.', '<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -21.3pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">[1].<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -21.3pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">Alam, S.K : Hydrobiological and physico-chemical analysis of the river Yamuna at Kalpi dist. Jalaun U.P., India. Ph.D. Thesis (Zoology) submitted to B.U. Jhansi, (2013).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;&#10;margin-left:21.3pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-21.3pt;&#10;mso-text-indent-alt:-21.3pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&#10;Arial\">[2].<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;&#10;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">APHA : Standard Methods for the Examination of water and wastewater. 21<sup>st</sup> ed. Washington D.C. USA. (2005).<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;&#10;margin-left:21.3pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-21.3pt;&#10;mso-text-indent-alt:-21.3pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&#10;Arial\">[3].<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;&#10;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Bhadja, P and Vaghela. A : Status of river water quality of Saurashtra, Gujarat, India. Int. J Adv Bio Res. 2013; 3(2) : 276-280, (2013).<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;&#10;margin-left:21.3pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-21.3pt;&#10;mso-text-indent-alt:-21.3pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&#10;Arial\">[4].<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;&#10;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">BIS. 10500 : Specification for drinking water. Indian Standard Institution ( Indian Bureau of standard), New Delhi. 1991.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;&#10;margin-left:21.3pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-21.3pt;&#10;mso-text-indent-alt:-21.3pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&#10;Arial\">[5].<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: