 disease with increasing heterogeneity. <i>Lancet</i>. 383 (9922): 1084-1094.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n    <li><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Book Antiqua&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&#10;&quot;Book Antiqua&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Book Antiqua&quot;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;&#10;font-family:&quot;Book Antiqua&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Yi B, Huang G, Zhou Z (2016) Different role of zinc transporter 8 between type 1 diabetes mellitus and type 2 diabetes mellitus. <i>J Diabetes Investig</i>, 7(4): 459-465.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n    <li><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Book Antiqua&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&#10;&quot;Book Antiqua&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Book Antiqua&quot;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;&#10;font-family:&quot;Book Antiqua&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Islam SMS, Alam DS, Wahiduzzaman M, Louis W Niessend, Guenter Froesch. (2015). Clinical characteristics and complications of patients with type 2 diabetes attending an urban hospital in Bangladesh. <i>Diabetes Metab Syndr Clin Res Rev</i>, 9(1): 7-13.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n    <li><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Book Antiqua&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&#10;&quot;Book Antiqua&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Book Antiqua&quot;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;&#10;font-family:&quot;Book Antiqua&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Berman HM et al. The Protein Data Bank. <i>Nucleic Acids Res</i>. 2000. 28: 235-242.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n    <li><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Book Antiqua&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&#10;&quot;Book Antiqua&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Book Antiqua&quot;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;&#10;font-family:&quot;Book Antiqua&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Wang Y, Yanli Wang, Jewen Xiao, Tugba O Suzek, Jian Zhang, Jiyao Wang, Stephen H Bryant, PubChem: a public information system for analyzing bioactivities of small molecules. <i>Nucleic Acids Res</i>. 2014; 42: 5, 23-33.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n    <li><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Book Antiqua&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&#10;&quot;Book Antiqua&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Book Antiqua&quot;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;&#10;font-family:&quot;Book Antiqua&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Qingliang Li, Tiejun Cheng, Yanli Wang, Stephen H Bryant. PubChem as a public resource for drug discovery. <i>Drug Discov Today</i>. 2010 15: 1052;23-24.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n    <li><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Book Antiqua&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&#10;&quot;Book Antiqua&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Book Antiqua&quot;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;&#10;font-family:&quot;Book Antiqua&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Trott O and Olson A J 2010 AutoDockVina: improving the speed and accuracy of&nbsp; docking with a new scoring function, efficient optimization and multithreading.<i> J. Comput. Chem</i>. 31 455&ndash; 61<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n    <li><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Book Antiqua&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&#10;&quot;Book Antiqua&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Book Antiqua&quot;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; f