C. and S. Narumiya, Prostaglandinâ€cytokine crosstalk in chronic inflammation. British journal of pharmacology, 2019. 176(3): p. 337-354.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;&#10;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;color:#595959;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-themetint:&#10;166;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN;mso-bidi-language:TE\">Gunalan, G., et al., Anti-inflammatory activities of phytochemicals from Bauhinia variegata Linn. leaf: An in silico approach. J. chem. pharm, 2014. 6(9): p. 334-48.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;&#10;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;color:#595959;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-themetint:&#10;166;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN;mso-bidi-language:TE\">Gunalan, G., C. Romeo, and P. Sumathi, Docking Studies of Pyrazole Derivative as Anti-Inflammatory Drug With Cyclooxgenase-2. IJBST, 2011. 4(12): p. 82-86.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;&#10;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;color:#595959;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-themetint:&#10;166;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN;mso-bidi-language:TE\">Fu, J.-Y., et al., The induction and suppression of prostaglandin H2 synthase (cyclooxygenase) in human monocytes. Journal of Biological Chemistry, 1990. 265(28): p. 16737-16740.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;&#10;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;color:#595959;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-themetint:&#10;166;mso-ansi-language:EN-IN;mso-bidi-language:TE\">Crofford, L.J., et al., Cyclooxygenase-1 and-2 expression in rheumatoid synovial tissues. Effects of interleukin-1 beta, phorbol ester, and corticos