transforms:&#xA;&quot;lumm=65000 lumo=35000&quot;;mso-bidi-language:HI\">Ph.D., D.Sc<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:&#xA;normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;&#xA;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#595959;mso-themecolor:text1;&#xA;mso-themetint:166;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#595959;mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor:&#xA;text1;mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha:100.0%;mso-style-textfill-fill-colortransforms:&#xA;&quot;lumm=65000 lumo=35000&quot;;mso-bidi-language:HI\">School of Informatics and Electrical Engineering,<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:&#xA;normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;&#xA;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#595959;mso-themecolor:text1;&#xA;mso-themetint:166;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#595959;mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor:&#xA;text1;mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha:100.0%;mso-style-textfill-fill-colortransforms:&#xA;&quot;lumm=65000 lumo=35000&quot;;mso-bidi-language:HI\">Oromia Regional State, Ethiopia</span></p>\r\n</div>', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00', 1);
INSERT INTO `contentpages` (`conid`, `title`, `dailytitle`, `description`, `photopath`, `photopath2`, `photopath3`, `photopath4`, `photopath5`, `photopath6`, `photopath7`, `photopath8`, `publishdate`, `status`) VALUES
(6, ' Guidelines to Authors', '', '<h2><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 128);\">Author Guidelines:</span></span></span></h2>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">The American Journal of Science and Medical Research (AJSMR), is a International, Multidisciplinary, Online peer reviewed quarterly journal aimed to encourage and to get awareness for every individual in the field of&nbsp; sciences.</span></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br />\r\n</span></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">All articles should be original works and not already published, nor submitted for publication elsewhere.</span></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br />\r\n</span></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Author (s) is (are) solely responsible for authenticity of cited literature and originality of data being reported. Manuscripts are considered with the understanding that no part of the work has been published previously in any media and are not under consideration by another journal. The corresponding author is responsible for ensuring that all authors have agreed to the manuscript\'s content and its submission. All submissions are initially evaluated and checked for publication quality by the scientific editors. Manuscripts may be checked for plagiarism.</span></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br />\r\n</span></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">The authors of papers, in which experiments on animal were conducted, should give a statement of certification that &ldquo;Experiments on animals were performed in accordance with the guidelines and regulations set forth by {Name of Institution/Committee of the country where experiments carried out}&quot; and also should be in accordance with the internationally accepted principles for laboratory animal use and care.</span></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br />\r\n</span></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">-&nbsp; Please go through the Journal standards templete before sending&nbsp; </span></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; your manuscripts (<a href=\"/rmovies/images/userfiles/AJSMR TEMPLATE.doc\">Download the Paper Templete</a>).</span></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">-&nbsp; For more information on Manuscript preparation and Guidelines for </span></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; Authors, <a href=\"http://ajsmrjournal.com/authorguidelines.php\">Click here</a>.</span></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">-&nbsp; Download copy right form from <a href=\"/rmovies/images/userfiles/copy right certificate(2).pdf\">here (Copy Right Certificate)</a></span></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br />\r\n</span></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Submission:</span></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"> </span></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Manuscript should be submitted to editorajsmr@gmail.com or <a href=\"http://ajsmrjournal.com/submitmanuscript.php\">http://ajsmrjournal.com/submitmanuscript.php</a><br />\r\n</span></span></div>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00', 1),
(10, 'Editorial Board ', '', '<p>we</p>', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00', 1),
(11, 'Archiving & Digital Preservation Policy', '', '<div>\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><strong style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: large; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">Archiving &amp; Digital Preservation Policy</strong></span></span></h1>\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><strong style=\"font-size: medium; font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Journal Archive</span></strong></span></span></h1>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">All issues of The American Journal of Science and Medical Research (AJSMR) are permanently maintained and freely accessible through the journal\'s online archive at&nbsp;</span></span></span></span><a href=\"https://ajsmrjournal.com/archives.php\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: medium; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">ajsmrjournal.com/archives.php</span></span></a><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">, alongside the current issue at&nbsp;</span></span></span><a href=\"https://ajsmrjournal.com/currentissue.php\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: medium; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">ajsmrjournal.com/currentissue.php</span></span></a><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">.</span></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">As an Open Access journal, there is no embargo period &mdash; all content is freely available from the date of publication.</span></span></span></div>\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><strong style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Indexing and Discoverability</span></strong></span></span></h1>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">To support long-term discoverability and preservation of published content, AJSMR is indexed with, or included in, the following:</span></span></span></div>\r\n<ul style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;\">\r\n    <li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Directory of Open Access Journals (DOAJ)</span></span></span></li>\r\n    <li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Google Scholar</span></span></span></li>\r\n    <li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Index Copernicus</span></span></span></li>\r\n    <li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Indian Science Abstracts</span></span></span></li>\r\n    <li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">NCBI-PubMed Researcher ID</span></span></span></li>\r\n    <li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Publons</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><strong style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Author Self-Archiving</span></strong></span></span></h1>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">AJSMR permits authors to self-archive the final accepted version of their published articles in any OAI-compliant institutional or subject-based repository, in line with the journal\'s Open Access, Copyright &amp; Self-Archiving Policy. This supports redundant, distributed preservation of the journal\'s content beyond the publisher\'s own servers.</span></span></span></p>\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><strong style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Continuity of Access</span></span></strong></span></span></h1>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">In the unlikely event that AJSMR ceases publication, Advaitha Innovative Research Association (AIRA) is committed to making reasonable arrangements to ensure that previously published articles remain accessible to the scientific community, including through the indexing repositories listed above and any institutional repositories in which authors have self-archived their work.</span></span></span></p>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00', 1),
(12, 'Open Access, Copyright &amp; Self-Archiving Policy', '', '<p>&nbsp;Open Access, Copyright &amp;amp; Self-Archiving Policy</p>', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00', 1),
(13, 'Plagiarism, Research Integrity & Retraction Policy', '', '<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2>Plagiarism, Research Integrity &amp; Retraction Policy</h2>', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00', 1),
(14, 'Privacy & Data Protection Policy', '', '<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2>Privacy &amp; Data Protection Policy</h2>', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '0000-00-00', 1);
